{"id":"poehtomu","lemma":"поэтому","pos":"adv","rank":139,"glosses":["so, therefore, that's why"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/ba/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я звоню тебе не поэтому.","en":"That's not why I'm calling you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264721","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to call","l":"звонить"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Ты поэтому хочешь меня убить?","en":"Is that why you want to kill me?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"to kill"}]},{"text":"Так ты поэтому сюда пришёл?","en":"That's why you came here, isn't it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1278714","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"here, hither"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Вы поэтому здесь?","en":"Is that why you're here?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Том не поэтому этого хочет.","en":"That's not why Tom wants that.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"not"},null,null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]}]}